Package: openmux-hardware
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OpenMux <support@openmux.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/OpenMux
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: OpenMux hardware identity (internal FTDI console)
 Runtime service that records the identity (manufacturer/product/serial)
 of the console's internal FTDI chip (serial EEPROM matching OMH*-A) to
 /etc/openmux-hardware, plus udev symlinks /dev/openmux/<port> for the
 exposed console ports.
